{"title":"Sand Wyrm","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 48 Sand Wyrm that attacks with crush (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">stab</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">crush</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 3 times (4.1% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/deathstalker-venom\">Deathstalker Venom</a> <span class=\"muted\">(infuses an enchant)</span>. About 1 kill in 500, 1 in 50 from an elite. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Enchanter’s Table</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/sand-wyrm\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/sand-wyrm?lv=47\">Lv 47 <span>53</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/sand-wyrm?lv=48\">Lv 48 <span>49</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/sand-wyrm?lv=49\">Lv 49 <span>26</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/sand-wyrm?lv=50\">Lv 50 <span>64</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/sand-wyrm\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>47</b></td><td>266</td><td>30.4</td><td>2,350</td><td class=\"muted\">798 · 42.6 · 7,050</td><td>53</td><td>in the wilds around 1994, 896</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/sand-wyrm?lv=48\" title=\"Pick level 48\"><td><b>48</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>278</td><td>30.9</td><td>2,400</td><td class=\"muted\">834 · 43.3 · 7,200</td><td>49</td><td>in the wilds around 1993, 891</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/sand-wyrm?lv=49\" title=\"Pick level 49\"><td><b>49</b></td><td>290</td><td>31.5</td><td>2,450</td><td class=\"muted\">870 · 44.1 · 7,350</td><td>26</td><td>in the wilds around 2076, 880</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/sand-wyrm?lv=50\" title=\"Pick level 50\"><td><b>50</b></td><td>303</td><td>32</td><td>2,500</td><td class=\"muted\">909 · 44.8 · 7,500</td><td>64</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Old%20Maw's%20Sands\">Old Maw&#39;s Sands</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"sand-wyrm\" data-map-level=\"47\">Show level 47 on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 9 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 9 recorded drops, 933 total, 36–186 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×36–186</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"wyrm-hide\" title=\"Wyrm Hide - in 9 of 9 looted corpses, 7 recorded drops, 12 total, 1–2 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/97b6093fa51dfdf6f46d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Wyrm Hide</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×1–2</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"wyrm-tooth\" title=\"Wyrm Tooth - in 6 of 9 looted corpses, 5 recorded drops, 7 total, 1–2 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/20d4d609ca4b783a9215.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Wyrm Tooth</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.5<br>×1–2</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"dragonhide-feet\" title=\"Dragonhide Feet - in 1 of 9 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/3d45df5330ab70a2d5c7.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dragonhide Feet</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/9<br>×1</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+1 more\">+1 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"mana-potion-large\" title=\"Mana Potion Large - in 1 of 9 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/a4a127458a5f5f489058.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Mana Potion Large</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/9<br>×1</span></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>⭐ Elite loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link elite\" data-item=\"wyrm-hide\" title=\"Wyrm Hide - in 9 of 9 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 7 total, 3–4 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/97b6093fa51dfdf6f46d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Wyrm Hide</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×3–4</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link elite\" data-item=\"wyrm-tooth\" title=\"Wyrm Tooth - in 6 of 9 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 4 total, 4 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/20d4d609ca4b783a9215.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Wyrm Tooth</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.5<br>×4</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link elite\" data-item=\"dragonscale-legs\" title=\"Dragonscale Legs - in 1 of 9 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/7c1ec86af5a4c2f2cf54.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dragonscale Legs</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/9<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Superior: 1 of 1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link elite\" data-item=\"stamina-potion-large\" title=\"Stamina Potion Large - in 1 of 9 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/7fdf25f5efb0344b88a4.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Stamina Potion Large</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/9<br>×1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses whose loot was recorded; kills nobody looted are not counted), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-755.5px,-993.1px)\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/2/3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:512px;top:768px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/2/4.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:512px;top:1024px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/3/3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:768px;top:768px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/3/4.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:768px;top:1024px\"><i style=\"left:865.6px;top:1018.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:794.8px;top:1036.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:743.9px;top:999.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:717.1px;top:963.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:745.9px;top:993.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:802.3px;top:992.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:706.1px;top:953.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:794.1px;top:981.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:855.9px;top:1023.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:738.4px;top:966.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:841.5px;top:1011.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:777.6px;top:990.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:708.8px;top:960.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:780.3px;top:1025.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:745.9px;top:976.9px\